  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Table 3. Figuring Nonfarm Net Earnings</h3>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>If your gross income is less than $2,400 or less than $1,600</th>
            <th>Then your net earnings from self-employment is</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Less than $2,400</td>
            <td>$0</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>More than $2,400</td>
            <td>Your gross income minus your allowable deductions.</td>
          </tr>
