    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Earned Income Credit</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4;">The earned income credit is a credit for certain earned income. You may be able to claim this credit if your income is below a certain amount.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4;">You do not have to qualify as a qualifying child to claim this credit. You must meet other requirements.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4;">If you qualify, you can claim the credit if your earned income is at least <span data-field="earned_income_threshold">{{ earned_income_threshold }}</span>.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Form W-2 From Church</h2>
