      <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4;">Box 2. The church withheld <span data-field="tax_withheld">{{ tax_withheld }}</span> in federal income tax.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4;">Boxes 3 and 5. As an employee of the college, you are subject to withholding for federal income tax and Social Security tax.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4;">Box 14. The church entered Rev. <span data-field="wages_box14">{{ wages_box14 }}</span> in wages.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.4;">Box 19. The church entered <span data-field="other_income_box19">{{ other_income_box19 }}</span> in other income.</p>
